<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Affiche TDBR — {{ depotNom }}</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 0;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #2C2416;
            background: #fff;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }

        .page {
            width: 210mm;
            height: 297mm;
            position: relative;
            background: #FAF6EE;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Bandeaux décoratifs */
        .ribbon-top {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 12mm; background: #2C2416;
        }
        .ribbon-bottom {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 14mm; background: #8B7355;
        }

        .corner-deco {
            position: absolute;
            width: 60mm; height: 60mm;
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.18;
        }
        .corner-deco.tr { top: -30mm; right: -30mm; background: #D4AF7A; }
        .corner-deco.bl { bottom: 14mm; left: -25mm; background: #D4AF7A; }

        /* En-tête */
        .header {
            position: absolute;
            top: 18mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header img {
            max-height: 24mm;
            width: auto;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .header .brand-fallback {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 36pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: #2C2416;
        }
        .header .tagline {
            margin-top: 4mm;
            font-size: 10pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Hero image */
        .hero {
            position: absolute;
            top: 60mm; left: 50%;
            margin-left: -55mm;
            width: 110mm; height: 80mm;
            background: #fff;
            border: 3pt solid #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1pt #D4AF7A;
            text-align: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero img {
            max-width: 100%;
            max-height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* Bloc message */
        .message {
            position: absolute;
            top: 152mm; left: 20mm; right: 20mm;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .message h1 {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 32pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            line-height: 1.05;
            margin-bottom: 6mm;
        }
        .message h1 em {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 900;
        }
        .message p {
            font-size: 12pt;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #5C4F3C;
            max-width: 150mm;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Bloc QR */
        .qr-zone {
            position: absolute;
            top: 200mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .qr-card {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6mm;
            background: #fff;
            border: 2pt solid #2C2416;
        }
        .qr-card img {
            display: block;
            width: 50mm; height: 50mm;
        }
        .url {
            margin-top: 6mm;
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .url-prefix {
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #8B7355;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 2mm;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 4mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #FAF6EE;
            font-size: 9pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .footer strong { font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }

        /* Filets décoratifs */
        .divider {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            margin-left: -25mm;
            width: 50mm;
            height: 1pt;
            background: #D4AF7A;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
    {# Bandeaux + cercles décoratifs #}
    <div class="ribbon-top"></div>
    <div class="corner-deco tr"></div>
    <div class="corner-deco bl"></div>
    <div class="ribbon-bottom"></div>

    {# Logo / brand #}
    <div class="header">
        {% if logoBase64 %}
            <img src="{{ logoBase64 }}" alt="TDBR">
        {% else %}
            <div class="brand-fallback">TDBR</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="tagline">Goodies &amp; Créations Street-Art</div>
    </div>

    {# Image d'accueil encadrée #}
    {% if heroBase64 %}
    <div class="hero">
        <img src="{{ heroBase64 }}" alt="Création TDBR">
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# Filet sous l'image #}
    <div class="divider" style="top: 145mm;"></div>

    {# Message principal #}
    <div class="message">
        <h1>Un modèle vous plaît ?<br><em>Trouvez votre taille en ligne.</em></h1>
        <p>
            Pas la bonne taille en boutique ? Envie de découvrir l'ensemble des créations TDBR ?
            Toute la collection est disponible sur notre site, livraison à domicile ou en point relais.
        </p>
    </div>

    {# QR + URL #}
    <div class="qr-zone">
        <div class="qr-card">
            <img src="{{ qrDataUri }}" alt="QR code vers tedybear.fr">
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:5mm;">
            <span class="url-prefix">Scannez ou tapez</span>
            <span class="url">{{ siteLabel }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Footer dépôt #}
    <div class="footer">
        Vu chez <strong>{{ depotNom }}</strong>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
